research/audit/genrisk.json:953:        "notes": "Tried in order. RETAG declined: the exact five-property, page-local scope ledger is a bespoke synthesis of this library's theorem package rather than a located source statement. RESTATE and NARROW declined because it states precisely the proved implication pattern: LUB, BW, and MCT force Archimedeanness, while the ordered Laurent field has shrinking NIP and sequential CC without either Archimedeanness or LUB. UNFOLD is inapplicable because logical_consumers is empty; the two cone edges are wikilink orientation mentions. Alpha counterexample-searched every clause against the Laurent witness, checked the shrinking qualifier and the distinction between sequential Cauchy completeness and LUB completeness, and found no stronger claim. The current DeepSeek V4 Pro audit-refuter read the complete remark and all thirteen supplied dependencies and returned CLEAN; the exact result/log/prompt triple is preserved at research/audit/wave7-preserved-refuters/rem-where-the-archimedean-hypothesis-is-needed--cf8617d2b205db18.result.json with normalized item hash f497ff277a907e1340fcec327b95513997ff5d08e64fa67c1f3f5f848ae97e5c. The historical judge pass is retained, paired current judge coverage remains mandatory before publication, and the two-item mention cone stays frozen."
